  "description": "spaCy-class NLP for .NET: the model-free core. Doc, Span and Token with character offsets into the original text; tokenizers that match Hugging Face tokenizers byte for byte; sentence segmentation; Matcher and EntityRuler; recognizers for numbers, units, currency, dates and times in ten languages; language identification for 75 languages. No native code, NativeAOT and trim clean. Unaffiliated with other projects named OneNLP.",
